# .gitignore — SSP-Exchange GitOps config repo (Helm charts + env values + Argo CD manifests).
# This repo is the source of truth Argo CD syncs; keep it to SOURCE only — no build artifacts,
# no secrets, no local render dumps.

# --- Helm build artifacts (regenerated, not source) ---
# Vendored subchart tarballs unpacked into a chart's charts/ dir. Our charts are INDEPENDENT
# (no dependencies), but ignore these so a stray `helm dependency build` never commits copies.
charts/*/charts/
*.tgz

# --- Secrets: NEVER commit (secrets live in AWS Secrets Manager, synced by ESO) ---
# ExternalSecret manifests ARE fine to commit — they hold only REFERENCES, not values.
# This is a defensive net for accidental secret-bearing files; real secrets should never be here.
.env
*.env
*.dec
secrets.yaml
secret-values.yaml
*-secret-values.yaml

# --- Local render / debug output ---
# e.g. `helm template ... > rendered.yaml` while eyeballing manifests locally.
rendered.yaml
*.rendered.yaml

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
